{
  "date": "2026-11-03",
  "category": "fintech",
  "title_zh": "香港转数快计划年内连接银联国际，支持扫码支付",
  "title_en": "Hong Kong's FPS plans to link with UnionPay International this year, supporting QR payments",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "zh": "香港金融管理局说，香港的转数快计划在今年内和银联国际连接。转数快是香港的即时转账系统。",
      "en": "The Hong Kong Monetary Authority said that Hong Kong's Faster Payment System (FPS, 转数快) plans to connect with UnionPay International within this year. FPS is Hong Kong's instant transfer system."
    },
    {
      "zh": "连接完成后，香港用户可以扫二维码付款。这项服务会慢慢扩大到40多个市场，覆盖1亿多家商户。第一阶段包括香港、中国内地、澳门、马来西亚和韩国。",
      "en": "After the connection is finished, Hong Kong users will be able to pay by scanning QR codes. The service will gradually expand to more than 40 markets, covering over 100 million merchants. The first phase includes Hong Kong, mainland China, Macau, Malaysia and South Korea."
    },
    {
      "zh": "金管局的金融科技总监周惠强表示，金管局正在和银联国际做技术对接。各地区的开通顺序，会在未来几个月公布。二维码付款也会有交易限额和防诈骗措施。",
      "en": "Chow Wai-keung, the HKMA's Chief Fintech Officer, said the HKMA is working with UnionPay International on the technical integration. The order in which each region goes live will be announced in the coming months. QR payments will also come with transaction limits and anti-fraud measures."
    },
    {
      "zh": "金管局副总裁李达志表示，金管局会争取比较好的汇率和手续费标准，具体做法要看各个市场的推广安排。",
      "en": "Li Dazhi, Deputy Chief Executive of the HKMA, said the HKMA will try to get good exchange rates and fee standards, and the exact approach depends on each market's rollout plans."
    }
  ],
  "source": {
    "name": "移动支付网",
    "name_en": "Mpaypass (China Mobile Payment Network)",
